WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.580
Voting, for me was non-existent.

2
00:00:04.580 --> 00:00:05.820
Why?

3
00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:07.920
My mother was not a voter.

4
00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:09.540
She had a fourth grade education.

5
00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:15.320
And you knew the only way you could vote was to go to the courthouse and take a test.

6
00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:18.860
How you going to take a test if you only had a fourth grade education?

7
00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:27.040
So the people in my family did not have the education to go to register to vote.

8
00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:35.940
And as I grew older, and was in school, and learned what the voting right was all about, I registered to vote.

9
00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:42.620
Because I learned that the people that gave their lives for me to be able to have that privilege,

10
00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:48.820
it would be a letdown to them to know I had that right and didn't act on it.
